        "zh-CN": "云骑剑经 • 山倾"
      },
      "description": {
        "pt-BR": "Causa Dano Físico igual a #1[i]% do ATQ de Sushang a um inimigo. Além disso, há #3[i]% de chance de ativar a Postura da Espada no último golpe, causando Dano Físico Adicional igual a #2[i]% do ATQ de Sushang ao inimigo.\nSe o inimigo estiver infligido com Quebra de Fraqueza, a ativação da Postura da Espada é garantida.",
        "en": "Deals Physical DMG equal to #1[i]% of Sushang's ATK to one designated enemy. In addition, there is a #3[i]% chance to trigger \"Sword Stance\" on the final hit, dealing Physical Additional DMG equal to #2[i]% of Sushang's ATK to the enemy.\nIf the enemy is inflicted with Weakness Break, \"Sword Stance\" is guaranteed to trigger.",
        "zh-CN": "对指定敌方单体造成等同于素裳#1[i]%攻击力的物理属性伤害。同时最后一击后有#3[i]%概率发动【剑势】，对目标造成等同于素裳#2[i]%攻击力的物理属性附加伤害。\n若该目标处于弱点击破状态，则【剑势】必定发动。"
      },
